anycalib-nuke
=============

This project depends on the following works.

* AnyCalib, Javier Tirado-Garín and Javier Civera, github.com/javrtg/AnyCalib.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The network weights are
  downloaded and exported by tools/export_anycalib.py; they are not part of
  this repository. The network on Hugging Face (mushyfruit/anycalib-nuke),
  models/anycalib_dist.pt, is AnyCalib's anycalib_dist weights fine-tuned for
  this project.

* PyTorch (libtorch), BSD-3-Clause License. Its headers are fetched at build
  time; the plugin runs on the libtorch libraries Nuke ships and bundles none.

* Nuke NDK headers, Foundry. Used under the Nuke NDK terms; not redistributed.
